'''Ender Dragons''' are 7 different variants of [[Boss]] summoned with [[Summoning Eye]]s in the [[Dragon's Nest]]. They drop powerful loot including [[Dragon Armor]]s and [[Dragon Fragment]]s when killed.

The Ender Dragon has 7 variants: Protector, Wise, Unstable, Superior, Strong, Young and Old.

== Mechanics ==
=== Summoning ===
The '''Ender Dragon''' is summoned with {{Item|Summoning Eye|amount=8}}s. These eyes must be placed in the altar in the center of the nest. After all 8 are placed, the dragon is summoned and the fight will begin. This is similar to the summoning of [[Arachne]] with [[Arachne's Calling|Arachne's Callings]].

