=== Quality System ===
Each player that damages the Ender Dragon will receive individual loot, including [[Ender Pearl]]s and [[Enchanted Ender Pearl]]s. Loot received is governed by '''Loot Quality''' (commonly incorrectly referred to as "Weight" by players), which determines a player's eligibility for major loot. Note that achieving a quality requirement does not guarantee the respective drop.

Total '''Loot Quality''' is calculated using this formula: <math>\text{Quality} = \text{BaseQuality} + 100(\text{SummoningEyesPlaced}) + 100 \left(\frac{\text{PlayerDamageDealt}}{\text{FirstPlaceDamageDealt}}\right)</math>

