== Bestiary ==
{{Bestiary Entry|section=The End|family=Dragon|name=Dragons|lore=Inside the Dragon's Den, there is no escape from the fury of the beasts.|bracket=6|max_tier=15|image=Dragon Egg}}

== Tips ==
*The {{Item|Dragon Shortbow}} is a relatively effective early game weapon to use for Dragon fights as it is easy to obtain (through the {{NPCSprite|Lone Adventurer}}'s quest) and deals decent damage.
*Due to the price of {{Item|Summoning Eye}}s, summoning '''Ender Dragons''' is generally not a good idea, as it commonly results in a loss of {{c}}.
*The {{Item|Draconic Talisman}}, {{Item|Draconic Ring}}, and {{Item|Draconic Artifact}} increase damage dealt to {{Purple|Dragons}} by 2%, 3%, and 5% respectively.
*Placing {{Green|4}} {{Item|Summoning Eye}}s and dealing at least 1 damage will make you eligible for the whole loot table of the Ender Dragon.
**This is why it is recommended to only use {{Green|4}} {{Item|Summoning Eye}}s yourself, unless you are specifically looking for the {{Item|Ender Dragon Pet}}, {{Item|Aspect of the Dragons}} or {{Item|Dragon Claw}}, where the amount of {{Item|Summoning Eye}}s used will affect the chance of these items dropping.

== Trivia ==
*Similar to other bosses, players will see their ranking for how much damage they dealt to the boss.
*The Ender Dragon was the second Boss added to the game.
*There is currently a bug in which in certain lobbies, summoned dragons will disappear after a player hits it with the {{Item|Aspect of the Dragons}} ability. The boss bar and {{NPCSprite|Gregory}} are still present, but the dragon itself is missing. [[Ender Crystal]]s still spawn around a minute after the disappearance, and it stays like that until the lobby resets.{{confirm}}
*When a Dragon is defeated, mobs, including {{MobSprite|Voidgloom Seraph}}s, in the lower areas of the {{Zone|Void Sepulture}} (between layers 10 and 26) will also despawn.{{confirm}}
*Holy Dragons do not exist, even though {{Item|Holy Dragon Armor}}, {{Item|Holy Dragon Fragment}}s, and Holy [[Lost Adventurer]]s do.

